{"ts": "2026-06-12T02:31:37.427234+00:00", "page_id": "p0086", "scope": "line", "target_id": "p0086_catchword_l0001", "field": "notes", "before": "", "after": "This is a signature which should be referencing that this is volume V of Erlington and Todd translation. However, notice that the printer erroneously entered `IV` here (the chapter number and not the book's volume number). `F` is the gathering of pages to be bound together. `A` signifies the ending of the first set of pages to be gathered. `B` (on this page) would signifies the second set of pages to be gathered and bound together. And so on.", "reviewer": "Paul Boys"}
